@startuml stage-3-implementation
title Stage 3 — Implementation  (/mi-plan-implementation)\nMain context vs. the isolated implementation chain

skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #888888
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

legend top left
  |<#FFF3CD>| Main-agent context |
  |<#D6EAF8>| Isolated chain context (separate session) |
  |<#E8DAEF>| Persisted artifact store (disk) |
  |<#D4EDDA>| Written this stage |
endlegend

package "Persisted artifact store" #E8DAEF {
  artifact "blueprints/current/requirements.md" as REQ
  artifact "blueprints/current/config.md\n(Skills/Rules auto-block, GIT BRANCH,\n Lessons learned, Inspector Additions)" as CFG
  artifact "summary.md (feature section)" as SUM
  artifact "todo-list.md" as TODO
  artifact "lessons-learned.md (if exists)" as LL
}

package "MAIN AGENT context" #FFF3CD {
  rectangle "At launch the millwright:\n• reads progress.md (active block)\n• composes blueprints/current/primer.md\n  (active scope, Goals excerpt, journal context,\n   likely-relevant skills/rules)\n• sets branch / base-commit / planning-mode\n  in progress.md\n• hands off to the chain (or runs direct mode)" as MAIN
}

package "Implementation chain\n(brainstorming mode = ISOLATED session;\n direct mode = runs inside main)" #D6EAF8 {
  rectangle "Required first read:\n• primer.md\n\nOn-demand canonical fallbacks (when gaps surface):\n• requirements.md\n• config.md\n• summary.md (active feature section)\n• todo-list.md\n• lessons-learned.md (mandatory before planning)" as CHAIN
}

package "Written this stage" #D4EDDA {
  artifact "blueprints/current/primer.md" as PRIMER
  artifact "project source code +\ncommits  base-commit..HEAD" as SRC
}

MAIN --> PRIMER : compose at launch
MAIN --> CHAIN : hand off

PRIMER --> CHAIN : required first read
REQ ..> CHAIN : on demand
CFG ..> CHAIN : on demand
SUM ..> CHAIN : on demand
TODO ..> CHAIN : on demand
LL ..> CHAIN : on demand

CHAIN --> SRC : implement + commit

note bottom of CHAIN
  Inspector exits the chain and types /mi-continue
  to resume the main agent at Stage 4.
  In brainstorming mode the chain's reads never
  enter main context.
end note
@enduml
